{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1CO",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be ye followers of me, even as I also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now I praise you, brethren, that ye remember me in all things, and keep the ordinances, as I delivered ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I would have you know, that the head of every man is Christ; and the head of the woman ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man; and the head of Christ ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every man praying or prophesying, having ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " head covered, dishonoreth his head.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But every woman that prayeth or prophesieth with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " head uncovered, dishonoreth her head: for that is even all one as if she were shaved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if the woman is not covered, let her also be shorn: but if it is a shame for a woman to be shorn or shaved, let her be covered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For a man indeed ought not to cover ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " head, forasmuch as he is the image and glory of God: but the woman is the glory of the man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the man is not from the woman, but the woman from the man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither was the man created for the woman, but the woman for the man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this cause ought the woman to have power on ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " head, because of the angels.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, neither is the man without the woman, neither the woman without the man in the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For as the woman ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from the man, even so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man also by the woman; but all things from God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Judge in yourselves: Is it comely that a woman should pray to God uncovered?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Doth not even nature itself teach you, that if a man hath long hair, it is a shame to him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if a woman hath long hair, it is a glory to her: for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hair is given her for a covering.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if any man seemeth to be contentious, we have no such custom, neither the churches of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now in this that I declare ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", I praise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not, that ye come together not for the better, but for the worse.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For first of all, when ye come together in the church, I hear that there are divisions among you; and I partly believe it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For there must be also heresies among you, that they who are approved may be made manifest among you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When therefore ye come together in one place, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " is not to eat the Lord's supper.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For in eating every one taketh before ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "another",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his own supper: and one is hungry, and another is drunken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What? have ye not houses to eat and to drink in? or despise ye the church of God, and shame them that have not? What shall I say to you? shall I praise you in this? I praise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I have received from the Lord, that which also I delivered to you, That the Lord Jesus, the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "same",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " night in which he was betrayed, took bread:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when he had given thanks, he broke ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and said, Take, eat: this is my body, which is broken for you: this do in remembrance of me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "After the same manner also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he took",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the cup, when he had supped, saying, This cup is the new testament in my blood: this do ye, as often as ye drink ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", in remembrance of me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For as often as ye eat this bread, and drink this cup, ye do show the Lord's death till he shall come.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, whoever shall eat this bread, and drink ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cup of the Lord unworthily, shall be guilty of the body and blood of the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But let a man examine himself, and so let him eat of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bread, and drink of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cup.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he that eateth and drinketh unworthily, eateth and drinketh condemnation to himself, not discerning the Lord's body.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this cause many ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " weak and sickly among you, and many sleep.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if we would judge ourselves, we should not be judged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But when we are judged, we are chastened by the Lord, that we should not be condemned with the world.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, my brethren, when ye come together to eat, tarry one for another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.11.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.11.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if any man hungereth, let him eat at home; that ye come not together to condemnation. And the rest will I set in order when I come.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
